# IntelliROI Design System

**Aesthetic:** Terminal / Bloomberg / ops-console. Dark only. Sharp corners (≈0).

**Model:** Shared chassis (fonts/surfaces) + **role accent** via `data-role-theme` / `--role-accent`. Logo always brand mint `#00E5A8`.

## Chassis tokens

| Token | Hex | Use |
|-------|-----|-----|
| `ink` | `#09090B` | Page bg |
| `surface` | `#111827` | Panels |
| `text-primary` | `#F8FAFC` | Headings |
| `text-secondary` | `#CBD5E1` | Body |
| `hairline` | `#2A2A2A` | Borders |
| `brand` | `#00E5A8` | Logo / landing |
| `warning` / `danger` | `#F59E0B` / `#EF4444` | Semantics only |

## Role accents (interactive chrome)

`super-admin` `#67E8F9` · `ceo` `#E8C547` · `department-manager` `#4F8CFF` · `team-lead` `#2DD4BF` · `employee` `#00E5A8`

## Typography (never role-swap)

Inter (`font-sans`) + JetBrains Mono (`font-mono`, uppercase system labels)

## Patterns

Hairline mosaics · role-colored glow (not soft shadows) · Lucide 1.5 · ease `[0.22,1,0.36,1]`

## Don't

Light mode · purple/cream defaults · large radius · separate full themes per role · “Actual ROI”

See `.cursor/docs/ROLE_COLOR_IDENTITY.md` + skill `intelliroi-dashboard`.
